  <History Date="22-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from Magic Panel R to MagicPanel-R.  Fixed P/T speed move in dark function name." />
  <History Date="23-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised across product range.  Fixed channel mapping all modes." />
  <History Date="31-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised Col Preset across product range.  Added vdim to Extended mode cells." />
